  "title": "New Search Portal For Library Resources",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "The following functionalities organise your searches and access to the library’s resources more efficiently:\n\nA special service for members of ETH Zurich: Wherever possible, a link leads to the platform BrowZine , where the latest journal contents are listed clearly, independently of the publisher platforms.\n\nFor the E-Lending service, the electronic borrowing of academic eBooks for non-members of ETH Zurich, the access mode is indicated more clearly.\n\nAs usual, all the information on ETH Library’s holdings, services, collections and archives is available on the website at www.library.ethz.ch/en .\n\nETH Library's Search Portal"
    }
  ],
